#: ../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/guides/provider-porting.md:11
msgid ""
"Use this guide to add a maintained implementation with explicit resources "
"and measurable costs. A new family or mode requires behavior, configuration "
"and build integration together. Similar STM32/GD32 peripheral names do not "
"prove register compatibility."
msgstr ""
"使用本指南增加具有明确资源和可测成本的维护实现。新芯片家族或模式需要同时完成行为、配置和构建集成。STM32／GD32 "
"的外设名称相似，不能证明寄存器兼容。"

#: ../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/guides/provider-porting.md:16
msgid "Keep the layer boundary narrow"
msgstr "保持清晰而窄的分层边界"

