#: ../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/guides/provider-porting.md:31
msgid "Choose the source owner"
msgstr "确定源码归属"

#: ../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/guides/provider-porting.md:33
msgid ""
"![Current decision for shared register algorithms and exact SoC "
"integration](../assets/diagrams/driver-source-ownership.svg)"
msgstr ""
"![共享寄存器算法与精确 SoC 集成的当前判定](../assets/diagrams/driver-source-ownership.svg)"

#: ../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/guides/provider-porting.md:33
msgid ""
"Current decision for shared register algorithms and exact SoC integration"
msgstr "共享寄存器算法与精确 SoC 集成的当前判定"

#: ../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/guides/provider-porting.md:35
msgid ""
"FIG-31 classifies private controller work. Arrows are maintenance decisions,"
" not runtime calls. Sharing requires evidence for every selecting chip's "
"register layout, flags, ordering and reset compatibility, plus explicit "
"handling of its errata. Similar names or a successful compile do not "
"establish that evidence. Keep an unreviewed or incompatible protocol in its "
"exact SoC implementation."
msgstr ""
"FIG-31 "
"对私有控制器工作作归属判定。箭头表示维护决策，不是运行时调用。共享需要每个选入芯片的寄存器布局、位含义、访问顺序及复位兼容性证据，并显式处理其勘误。名称相似或编译成功不能建立这些证据。尚未复核或不兼容的协议保留在精确"
" SoC 实现中。"

#: ../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/guides/provider-porting.md:0
msgid "Change"
msgstr "变更"

#: ../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/guides/provider-porting.md:0
msgid "Source owner and required check"
msgstr "源码归属与必需检查"

#: ../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/guides/provider-porting.md:0
msgid "Public I/O contract or portable I/O rule"
msgstr "公共 I/O 合同或可移植 I/O 规则"

#: ../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/guides/provider-porting.md:0
msgid "`io/`; preserve the public ownership and failure contract"
msgstr "`io/`；保持公共所有权与失败合同"

#: ../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/guides/provider-porting.md:0
msgid "Reusable register-protocol algorithm"
msgstr "可复用寄存器协议算法"

#: ../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/guides/provider-porting.md:0
msgid ""
"`drivers/<kind>/<ip>/`; each SoC wrapper establishes the actual silicon "
"contract"
msgstr "`drivers/<kind>/<ip>/`；每个 SoC wrapper 确认实际硅片合同"

#: ../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/guides/provider-porting.md:0
msgid "Part, memory, clock, reset, pin, IRQ or DMA integration"
msgstr "料号、内存、时钟、复位、引脚、IRQ 或 DMA 集成"

#: ../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/guides/provider-porting.md:0
msgid ""
"Exact `soc/<vendor>/<family>/`; facts, configuration policy and private C "
"retain distinct jobs"
msgstr "精确 `soc/<vendor>/<family>/`；事实、配置策略与私有 C 保持各自职责"

#: ../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/guides/provider-porting.md:0
msgid "Private SoC collaboration helper"
msgstr "私有 SoC 协作辅助代码"

#: ../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/guides/provider-porting.md:0
msgid ""
"Narrowest reviewed SoC scope; `soc/common/uart_control.h` is cross-vendor, "
"while STM32 identity access is vendor-specific"
msgstr ""
"最窄的已复核 SoC 范围；`soc/common/uart_control.h` 跨厂家共享，STM32 identity 访问则属于厂家特定范围"

#: ../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/guides/provider-porting.md:0
msgid "External device, protocol or product policy"
msgstr "外部器件、协议或产品策略"

#: ../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/guides/provider-porting.md:0
msgid ""
"Existing component ports or the external product, according to the "
"[integration contract](../design/integration-contracts.md)"
msgstr "按[接入合同](../design/integration-contracts.md)放入既有组件端口或外部产品"

#: ../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/guides/provider-porting.md:49
msgid ""
"The SoC target selects shared sources through explicit CMake entries and "
"private includes. The driver directory does not choose routes, clock "
"profiles or an ABI, and its presence does not add a maintained mode. Never "
"introduce a runtime forwarder merely to match a source directory."
msgstr ""
"SoC target 通过显式 CMake 条目和私有 include 选择共享源码。driver 目录不选择路由、时钟 profile 或 "
"ABI，目录存在也不增加维护中的模式。不得只为匹配源码目录而引入运行时转发层。"

#: ../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/guides/provider-porting.md:54
msgid "Implement in a reviewable sequence"
msgstr "按可评审的顺序实现"

#: ../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/guides/provider-porting.md:56
msgid ""
"Prepare the [fixed source and recursive dependencies](source-checkout.md). "
"Define the new behavior, supported modes, public ownership obligations and "
"rejection boundaries before changing its production implementation."
msgstr "准备[固定源码与递归依赖](source-checkout.md)。改变生产实现前，先定义新行为、支持模式、公共所有权义务和拒绝边界。"

#: ../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/guides/provider-porting.md:59
msgid ""
"Add and execute a meaningful RED GoogleTest/GoogleMock contract against the "
"current production path. Retain the actual command, nonzero execution and "
"expected failing assertion. Test MMIO/CPU/dependency ports through mocks; "
"Python resolver behavior uses stdlib unittest. A missing tool or compile-"
"only error is not the expected behavioral RED result."
msgstr ""
"为当前生产路径新增并执行有意义的 RED GoogleTest／GoogleMock 合同。保留实际命令、非零执行及预期失败断言。通过 mock 测试 "
"MMIO／CPU／依赖端口；Python 解析器行为使用标准库 unittest。工具缺失或只有编译错误，不能当作预期的行为 RED 结果。"

#: ../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/guides/provider-porting.md:64
msgid ""
"Add exact `soc.json`/`routes.json` facts and documented provenance. Feed the"
" shared CPU resolver; do not duplicate CPU flags or infer optional features."
" Place MCU implementations under `soc/<vendor>/<family>/` and declare that "
"canonical `source_directory` in the maintained family descriptor. Public "
"family identifiers stay independent of the directory. CPU implementation "
"sources belong under their ISA, such as `arch/arm/cortex_m/`; reviewed "
"cross-vendor register algorithms belong in `drivers/<kind>/<ip>/` only after"
" checking each participating silicon contract. Cross-vendor SoC "
"collaboration stays in `soc/common/`; STM32 identity helpers stay in "
"`soc/stm32/common/`."
msgstr ""
"添加精确的 `soc.json`／`routes.json` 事实并记录来源。使用共享 CPU resolver，不重复 CPU "
"flags，也不推断可选功能。将 MCU 实现放在 `soc/<vendor>/<family>/`，并在维护中的家族 descriptor 声明该规范"
" `source_directory`。公共家族标识独立于目录。CPU 实现按 ISA 放置，例如 "
"`arch/arm/cortex_m/`；经复核的跨厂家寄存器算法只有在核对各参与芯片合同后才能放入 "
"`drivers/<kind>/<ip>/`。跨厂家 SoC 协作保留在 `soc/common/`；STM32 identity helper 保留在"
" `soc/stm32/common/`。"

#: ../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/guides/provider-porting.md:73
msgid ""
"Add the family to the explicit maintained provider map in "
"`tools/configure/`. Place its production configuration package in "
"`soc/<vendor>/<family>/configure/` (Native uses `soc/native/configure/`) and"
" its configuration tests in `tools/configure/tests/providers/<family>/`. "
"Define supported modes, numerical limits, constructors, rollback and IRQ "
"wiring. Return an explicit frozen `Construction` record, including the "
"private state type and failed-init cleanup responsibility. Initialize and "
"stop actions use `DirectCall` values under the [constructor "
"contract](../design/official-stm32-provider.md#build-time-provider-"
"contract); raw C expressions are not accepted in those fields. Do not "
"require family-name inference in common generation. Unsupported modes "
"reject; there is no runtime registration or plugin discovery."
msgstr ""
"在 `tools/configure/` 的显式维护 provider 表中添加该系列。生产配置包放在 "
"`soc/<vendor>/<family>/configure/`（Native 使用 `soc/native/configure/`），配置测试放在"
" `tools/configure/tests/providers/<family>/`。定义支持模式、数值限制、构造器、回滚与 IRQ "
"接线。返回显式冻结的 `Construction` 记录，包含私有状态类型及初始化失败后的清理责任。Initialize 和 stop "
"动作使用[构造合同](../design/official-stm32-provider.md#build-time-provider-"
"contract)中的 `DirectCall` 值；这些字段不接受原始 C "
"表达式。公共生成器不依赖系列名称推断。不支持的模式应拒绝；不引入运行时注册或插件发现。"

#: ../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/guides/provider-porting.md:84
msgid ""
"Add explicit CMake targets and private SDK dependencies. Update declared "
"resolver reconfiguration inputs and the Source SDK required-file closure."
msgstr "增加显式 CMake 目标与私有 SDK 依赖。更新解析器声明的重新配置输入，以及 Source SDK 的必需文件闭包。"

#: ../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/guides/provider-porting.md:86
msgid ""
"Implement the smallest correct production change. Define an immutable public"
" face with shared readonly ops and independent context. Reuse public Nexus "
"types; keep vendor structures and concrete storage private. Review official "
"HAL/LL reuse before duplicating a vendor state machine. Apply [the official-"
"driver boundary](../design/official-stm32-provider.md) to time, callbacks, "
"cancellation, private dependencies and mode-specific comparison."
msgstr ""
"实施最小正确生产变更。定义不可变公共 face，共享只读 ops，并使用独立 context。复用 Nexus "
"公共类型，厂商结构与具体存储保持私有。复制厂商状态机前，先审查官方 HAL/LL "
"复用。时间、回调、取消、私有依赖与逐模式比较遵守[官方驱动边界](../design/official-stm32-provider.md)。"

#: ../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/guides/provider-porting.md:92
msgid ""
"Execute GREEN against the real provider. Verify rejection without residual "
"effects, accepted borrow, cancel/deadline, failed drain, quarantine, "
"stop/restart and instance isolation where the mode needs them."
msgstr "对真实提供者执行 GREEN。按模式需要验证无残留效果的拒绝、接受后的借用、取消／截止时间、排空失败、隔离保留、停止／重启和实例隔离。"

#: ../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/guides/provider-porting.md:95
msgid ""
"Refactor while keeping contracts passing. Link exact ARM fixtures and verify"
" actual resources, handler retention, vector bytes and unselected-driver "
"pruning. Validate an independent relocated SDK consumer and record physical "
"work as not executed."
msgstr ""
"保持合同通过再重构。链接精确 ARM 夹具，验证实际资源、处理函数保留、向量表字节和未选择驱动裁剪。验证独立搬移后的 SDK "
"消费工程，并将实板工作记录为未执行。"

#: ../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/guides/provider-porting.md:99
msgid ""
"For a component, pass explicit bus, GPIO, time and optional OS ports. Do not"
" create workers, probe devices, invent application roles or supply a maximum"
" object pool. Flash drivers expose physical geometry; persistence and update"
" policy remain external."
msgstr ""
"组件通过显式总线、GPIO、时间和可选 OS 端口工作。不得创建执行任务、探测设备、虚构应用角色或提供最大对象池。Flash "
"驱动暴露物理几何；持久化和升级策略仍在外部。"

#: ../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/guides/provider-porting.md:103
msgid ""
"Within each SoC's `configure/` package, `contract.py` owns mode "
"capabilities, ABI/limits and family admission policy. Sibling modules import"
" that contract directly; `__init__.py` explicitly exports it with "
"constructors and emitters. The leaf `providers/common.py` owns validation "
"helpers and immutable `Construction`; leaf contracts and common helpers do "
"not import the top-level resolver or emitter. `selection.py` checks cross-"
"domain options, clocks and IRQ policy, `ir.py` owns named immutable "
"decisions and their one-way JSON projection, and `matrix.py` orchestrates "
"support catalogues. The descriptor explicitly lists `configuration_modules`,"
" including `contract.py`, so edits trigger reconfiguration and remain in the"
" Source SDK closure."
msgstr ""
"每个 SoC 的 `configure/` 包中，`contract.py` "
"拥有模式能力、ABI／限制与系列准入策略。相邻模块直接导入该合同；`__init__.py` 将其与构造器、emitter 显式导出。叶模块 "
"`providers/common.py` 拥有校验辅助函数与不可变 `Construction`；叶合同及公共辅助模块不导入顶层 resolver 或"
" emitter。`selection.py` 检查跨域选项、时钟和 IRQ 策略；`ir.py` 拥有具名不可变决策及其单向 JSON "
"投影；`matrix.py` 编排支持目录。Descriptor 显式列出包含 `contract.py` 在内的 "
"`configuration_modules`，确保编辑触发重新配置，并保留在 Source SDK 闭包中。"

#: ../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/guides/provider-porting.md:114
msgid ""
"`tools/configure/contracts.py` owns immutable controller-category fields, "
"factory kind order and public header mappings. Authoring, selection and "
"factory consume that same metadata; exact SoC capabilities remain in the "
"family contract. Memory budgets, Flash layout and source dependencies have "
"frozen named stage results. One frozen device-graph result completes "
"controller, endpoint, USB FIFO, SPI face, ADC trigger, resource and DMA "
"decisions before final assembly. Its local validation builders may still use"
" dictionaries; the stage boundary does not claim that every normalizer is a "
"separate typed stage."
msgstr ""
"`tools/configure/contracts.py` 负责不可变的控制器类别字段、factory 类别顺序和公共头文件映射。编写、选择与 "
"factory 消费同一份元数据；精确 SoC 能力仍归家族合同负责。内存预算、Flash "
"布局和源码依赖具有冻结的具名阶段结果。一个冻结的设备图结果在最终装配之前完成控制器、端点、USB FIFO、SPI face、ADC "
"trigger、资源和 DMA 决策。它的局部校验构建过程仍可使用字典；这个阶段边界不代表每个 normalizer 都已拆成独立的类型化阶段。"

#: ../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/guides/provider-porting.md:123
msgid "Keep facts and admission policy distinct"
msgstr "区分事实与准入策略"

#: ../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/guides/provider-porting.md:125
msgid ""
"The exact `soc.json` variant supplies physical Flash origin, size, erase "
"blocks and RAM domains. Each family's `contract.PARTS` explicitly admits its"
" full part numbers through the frozen `PartPolicy`: the package and optional"
" memory-domain allowlist are software policy, not duplicate size tables. "
"Unknown parts, a different package or optional domains inconsistent with the"
" physical facts reject."
msgstr ""
"精确 `soc.json` variant 提供物理 Flash 起始地址、大小、擦除块和 RAM 域。每个家族的 `contract.PARTS` "
"通过冻结的 `PartPolicy` 显式准入完整料号：封装与可选内存域 allowlist "
"是软件策略，不是重复的容量表。未知料号、不同封装或与物理事实不一致的可选域均拒绝。"

#: ../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/guides/provider-porting.md:131
msgid ""
"Validation covers every maintained variant in the fact package, including "
"parts not selected by the current assembly. Each variant uses the same "
"package, Flash geometry, memory overlap, DMA reachability and `PartPolicy` "
"checks. Selection returns the existing selected facts; it does not repair a "
"malformed unselected part or copy another part's geometry."
msgstr ""
"校验覆盖事实包中的每个维护变体，包括当前装配未选中的料号。每个变体采用相同的封装、Flash 几何、内存重叠、DMA 可达性和 `PartPolicy`"
" 检查。选择过程返回已有的所选事实；不会修复错误的未选料号，也不会复制另一料号的几何。"

#: ../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/guides/provider-porting.md:137
msgid ""
"Trace an added part or mode through these maintained inputs before adding "
"its constructor:"
msgstr "添加构造器前，沿以下维护中的输入核对新增料号或模式："

#: ../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/guides/provider-porting.md:0
msgid "Input or projection"
msgstr "输入或投影"

#: ../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/guides/provider-porting.md:0
msgid "Maintainer's check"
msgstr "维护者检查"

#: ../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/guides/provider-porting.md:0
msgid "`soc.json` variant and `routes.json`"
msgstr "`soc.json` variant 与 `routes.json`"

#: ../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/guides/provider-porting.md:0
msgid ""
"Exact physical geometry, bonded pads, route provenance and finite mode "
"allowlist"
msgstr "精确物理几何、引出 pad、路由来源和有限模式 allowlist"

#: ../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/guides/provider-porting.md:0
msgid "Family `PARTS` and `PartPolicy`"
msgstr "家族 `PARTS` 与 `PartPolicy`"

#: ../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/guides/provider-porting.md:0
msgid "Explicit full part, reviewed package and optional placement domains"
msgstr "显式完整料号、已复核封装与可选放置域"

#: ../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/guides/provider-porting.md:0
msgid "`normalize_clock` and `clock_plan`"
msgstr "`normalize_clock` 与 `clock_plan`"

#: ../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/guides/provider-porting.md:0
msgid ""
"The exact family implements the selected profile and any reviewed domain "
"relationships"
msgstr "精确家族实现所选 profile 及经复核的时钟域关系"

#: ../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/guides/provider-porting.md:0
msgid "`i2c_timing_clock`"
msgstr "`i2c_timing_clock`"

#: ../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/guides/provider-porting.md:0
msgid ""
"`I2cTimingClock` carries selected kernel and peripheral clock bounds and "
"whether explicit timing is required; electrical assumptions remain authored"
msgstr "`I2cTimingClock` 携带所选内核与外设时钟边界，以及是否要求显式 timing；电气假设仍由装配编写者提供"

#: ../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/guides/provider-porting.md:0
msgid "Selected limits, format and silicon policy"
msgstr "所选限制、格式和硅片策略"

#: ../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/guides/provider-porting.md:0
msgid ""
"Metadata belongs to the exact selected owner; missing review remains "
"explicit and does not admit a mode"
msgstr "元数据属于精确选定 owner；缺失复核保持明确，不因此准入模式"

#: ../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/guides/provider-porting.md:0
msgid "`PhysicalPartIR`"
msgstr "`PhysicalPartIR`"

#: ../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/guides/provider-porting.md:0
msgid ""
"Views the same frozen part, package, Flash and memory facts; it adds no JSON"
" or configuration-identity field"
msgstr "查看同一组冻结的料号、封装、Flash 与内存事实；不增加 JSON 或配置身份字段"

#: ../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/guides/provider-porting.md:0
msgid "`ControllerIntegrationIR`"
msgstr "`ControllerIntegrationIR`"

#: ../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/guides/provider-porting.md:0
msgid ""
"Reuses canonical resource claims, DMA lanes, IRQ options/profile, clocks, "
"pins and the exact SoC hardware binding"
msgstr "复用规范资源 claim、DMA lane、IRQ 选项／profile、时钟、引脚及精确 SoC 硬件绑定"

#: ../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/guides/provider-porting.md:0
msgid "Family `UART_FORMATS`, `STREAM_GEOMETRY` and `ENDPOINT_POLICY`"
msgstr "家族 `UART_FORMATS`、`STREAM_GEOMETRY` 与 `ENDPOINT_POLICY`"

#: ../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/guides/provider-porting.md:0
msgid ""
"Explicit reviewed formats, stream geometry and endpoint capability; a vendor"
" alias or name prefix does not select a policy"
msgstr "显式经复核的格式、stream geometry 与 endpoint 能力；厂家别名或名称前缀不选择策略"

#: ../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/guides/provider-porting.md:0
msgid "Generated static C and private provider"
msgstr "生成的静态 C 与私有 provider"

#: ../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/guides/provider-porting.md:0
msgid ""
"Consume validated values and retain independent SDK/register assertions and "
"runtime failure checks"
msgstr "消费已校验数值，并保留独立 SDK／寄存器断言与运行时失败检查"

#: ../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/guides/provider-porting.md:152
msgid ""
"F407 Flash generation illustrates the boundary: its selected sector array "
"and readonly geometry come from validated `result.flash.erase_blocks`, "
"origin and size. The C SDK assertion still checks the physical base, and "
"independent register-model tests retain the reference geometry. Removing "
"duplicate production tables does not make configuration a substitute for "
"hardware validation."
msgstr ""
"F407 Flash 生成展示了该边界：所选 sector 数组与只读 geometry 来自已校验的 "
"`result.flash.erase_blocks`、起始地址和大小。C SDK "
"断言仍核对物理基址，独立寄存器模型测试保留参考几何。删除重复生产表不会让配置取代硬件校验。"

#: ../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/guides/provider-porting.md:158
msgid ""
"All seven maintained MCU families obtain generated readonly Flash geometry "
"from the validated facts through `memory.flash_geometry`. Six retain their "
"existing global geometry symbols; F407 emits selected static geometry. "
"Native remains a host model. The exact source and independently maintained "
"test oracle still need the applicable provider and linked-image checks."
msgstr ""
"维护中的七个 MCU 家族都通过 `memory.flash_geometry`，从已校验事实生成只读 Flash "
"geometry。六个家族保留既有全局 geometry symbol；F407 生成所选静态 geometry。Native "
"仍是主机模型。精确源码与独立维护的测试 oracle 仍须执行适用的 provider 和最终链接映像检查。"

#: ../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/guides/provider-porting.md:164
msgid ""
"`ConfigurationIR.physical_part` views the existing frozen Flash and memory "
"objects. `ControllerIR.integration` composes canonical `ResourcePlanIR` "
"claims, `DmaTopologyIR` lanes, IRQ options/profile, clock plan/inputs and "
"selected pins. It references a family `ControllerBinding` where that family "
"declares one. Its `clock_hz` is only the paired nominal APB input; a missing"
" value is not guessed, and reviewed frequency bounds come from `clock_plan`."
" Fixed reviewed SDK addresses, masks and Native model facts remain explicit "
"leaf data; they do not independently select a route, owner or clock. The "
"maintained-constructor consumption audit checks these selected records and "
"capability projections; it does not create a new route resolver or establish"
" final integrated qualification."
msgstr ""
"`ConfigurationIR.physical_part` 引用已有的冻结 Flash "
"和内存对象。`ControllerIR.integration` 组合权威 `ResourcePlanIR` "
"资源申领记录、`DmaTopologyIR` 通道、IRQ 选项／配置、时钟计划／输入和选定引脚。家族声明了 `ControllerBinding` "
"时，它会引用该记录。它的 `clock_hz` 仅表示配对的标称 APB 输入；缺失值不会猜测，已审查的频率边界来自 "
"`clock_plan`。固定且经过审查的 SDK 地址、掩码与 Native 模型事实仍是显式叶子数据；它们不独立选择路由、owner "
"或时钟。维护中构造器的消费审计检查这些选定记录与能力投影；它不引入新的路由 resolver，也不建立最终集成资格。"

#: ../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/guides/provider-porting.md:175
msgid ""
"Family policy hooks remain declared configuration inputs. H743's reviewed "
"clock domain relationships and selected Flash linker fragments live in its "
"`configure/` package; generic tools still own parsing, typed IR, resource "
"arbitration and atomic publication. A hook must not create a second source "
"graph or silently choose a different part, route or profile."
msgstr ""
"家族策略 hook 仍是声明的配置输入。H743 经复核的时钟域关系与所选 Flash linker fragment 位于其 `configure/`"
" 包；通用工具仍拥有解析、typed IR、资源仲裁与原子发布。hook 不得创建第二份源码图，也不得静默选择不同料号、路由或 profile。"

#: ../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/guides/provider-porting.md:181
msgid ""
"The paired F407/GD470 controller bindings, DMA vector maps and concrete "
"secondary controller hooks live with their SoC. Common code keeps resource "
"leases, fixed IRQ wiring and drain ordering while consuming the selected "
"typed integration. Coupled personalities and named pin states likewise "
"require explicit provider policy. Cross-Board/backend qualification remains "
"in its existing OS contract; moving family mechanisms does not broaden those"
" admitted combinations."
msgstr ""
"成对 F407／GD470 控制器的 binding、DMA vector map 与具体 secondary controller hook 位于各自"
" SoC。公共代码消费所选 typed integration，并保留资源 lease、固定 IRQ wiring 和 drain 顺序。耦合 "
"personality 与命名引脚状态同样要求显式 provider 策略。跨 Board／backend 资格仍属于既有 OS "
"合同；搬移家族机制不会扩大已准入组合。"

#: ../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/guides/provider-porting.md:188
msgid ""
"The read-only [work-package view](https://github.com/X-Gen-"
"Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-SOURCE/tools/maintenance/README.md) "
"connects exact maintained modes to resolver fixtures, selected ops sources "
"and reviewed lifecycle properties. Its entries are navigation, not executed "
"tests or new support declarations. Run actual applicable gates separately."
msgstr ""
"只读[工作包视图](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-"
"SOURCE/tools/maintenance/README.md)将精确维护模式关联到 resolver 夹具、所选 ops "
"源码与已审生命周期性质。视图条目用于导航，不是已执行测试或新增支持声明。实际适用门禁需要另行运行。"

#: ../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/guides/provider-porting.md:193
msgid "Keep hardware behavior in C"
msgstr "硬件行为使用 C 实现"

#: ../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/guides/provider-porting.md:195
msgid ""
"Firmware mechanisms use C11, with necessary assembly for startup and CPU "
"context. Python runs on the development host: it validates authored inputs, "
"resolves resources and emits static C/H declarations, instances, typed "
"factory getters, fixed IRQ entry connections and explicit typed calls. The "
"MCU executes compiled firmware and contains no Python interpreter."
msgstr ""
"固件机制使用 C11，启动和 CPU 上下文等位置保留必要的汇编。Python 在开发主机上运行：校验手写输入、解析资源，生成静态 C/H "
"声明、实例、typed factory getter、固定 IRQ 入口连接及明确的类型化调用。MCU 执行编译后的固件，不包含 Python 解释器。"

#: ../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/guides/provider-porting.md:201
msgid ""
"Maintain register reads and writes, hardware admission, waits, "
"pin/clock/IRQ/DMA acquisition, rollback, stop and recovery in concrete C "
"adapters. Generated definitions may retain constant register addresses and "
"immutable resource data; a fixed IRQ trampoline may directly call its "
"selected handler. Do not move these algorithms into a runtime action "
"interpreter or add a registry, hidden worker or mandatory lock. Test the "
"production C algorithm through hardware ports using GoogleTest/GoogleMock; "
"Python unittest verifies configuration and static wiring."
msgstr ""
"寄存器读写、硬件准入、等待、pin/clock/IRQ/DMA 取得、回滚、停止和恢复应直接维护在具体 C adapter "
"中。生成的定义可以保留常量寄存器地址和不可变资源数据；固定 IRQ 薄入口可以直接调用所选 "
"handler。不得将这些算法搬进运行时动作解释器，也不得增加 registry、隐藏 worker 或强制锁。通过硬件端口使用 "
"GoogleTest/GoogleMock 测试生产 C 算法；Python unittest 验证配置和静态连接。"

#: ../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/guides/provider-porting.md:209
msgid ""
"The reviewed Native and seven MCU-family increments include their maintained"
" cold paths. Shared enhanced-SPI admission uses read-only C checks before "
"resource acquisition or failed-init markers; H743 resume checks admission "
"before reopening its runtime domain and acquiring its lease. Dead hardware "
"emitters and unused default MMIO macros have been removed. Audit the whole "
"start/failure/stop/resume path, including shared owners and optional "
"retained components. A `DirectCall` in one constructor does not prove whole-"
"family or whole-source completion. Exact implementation and execution scopes"
" remain in the {download}`delivery-completion ledger <../design/platform-"
"delivery-completion.csv>`."
msgstr ""
"已审查的 Native 和七个 MCU 家族增量包含维护范围内的冷态路径。共享增强 SPI 准入在取得资源或设置启动失败标记之前执行只读 C "
"检查；H743 恢复在重新开放运行时域并取得租约之前检查准入。无用的硬件生成器和未使用的默认 MMIO "
"宏已删除。审查完整的启动／失败／停止／恢复路径，包括共享 owner 和可选保留组件。某个构造器中的一次 `DirectCall` "
"不能证明整个家族或全源码已经完成。精确实现与执行范围继续记录在{download}`交付完善台账 <../design/platform-"
"delivery-completion.csv>`中。"

#: ../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/guides/provider-porting.md:219
msgid ""
"Write readonly mode-specific configuration and exactly sized mutable "
"storage. The C prepare function validates context and foreign ownership "
"before effects; the C close function proves its receipt before touching an "
"existing provider. An empty receipt must leave unowned state unchanged. "
"After partial preparation, close must retain every unfinished pin, clock, "
"IRQ or DMA claim until readback proves return. Test both an alien empty "
"receipt and a genuine partial receipt; also test cleanup after the caller "
"has already stopped the public peripheral. Avoid duplicate persistent pin "
"snapshots or a maximum-sized union of all modes."
msgstr ""
"编写按模式区分的只读配置和精确大小的可变存储。C prepare 函数在产生效果前校验上下文与外部所有权；C close 函数在接触已有 "
"provider 前验证自身收据。空收据必须保持未取得的状态不变。部分准备后，close 必须保留每个尚未完成的引脚、时钟、IRQ 或 DMA "
"权利，直到读回证明已经归还。既要测试外来空收据，也要测试真实的部分取得收据；还要测试调用者已停止公开外设后的清理。避免重复的持久引脚快照或容纳所有模式最大状态的联合体。"

#: ../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/guides/provider-porting.md:228
msgid ""
"Keep schema fields and numerical policy in host validation. Keep runtime "
"MMIO reads, clock checks, publisher joins, waits and recovery in C. Declare "
"each new configuration helper and private C/header input in the existing "
"family descriptor and explicit CMake target. A successful host model does "
"not replace an actual ARM link, relocated SDK consumer or physical station "
"run."
msgstr ""
"将 schema 字段和数值策略留在主机校验中。将运行态 MMIO 读取、时钟检查、发布者汇合、等待与恢复留在 C 中。在既有家族 descriptor"
" 和显式 CMake target 中声明每个新增配置辅助模块及私有 C／头文件输入。主机模型成功不能替代实际 ARM 链接、迁址 SDK "
"消费者或物理工位执行。"

#: ../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/guides/provider-porting.md:234
msgid ""
"H743 fixed-run power references the selected logical controller ID in "
"`power.controllers`; the ID need not be `bus4`. Renaming the controller "
"requires updating both endpoint and power references. This preserves the "
"exact single SPI4 finite-DMA, baremetal, HSI64/cache-off contract; changing "
"a logical name does not admit another physical controller, clock profile or "
"backend."
msgstr ""
"H743 fixed-run power 通过 `power.controllers` 引用选中的逻辑控制器 ID，ID 无须命名为 "
"`bus4`。修改控制器名称时须同步修改端点和 power 引用。这仍严格限定为单个 SPI4 finite-"
"DMA、baremetal、HSI64/cache-off；改变逻辑名称不会准入另一物理控制器、时钟配置或后端。"

#: ../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/guides/provider-porting.md:240
msgid "Review performance and ownership"
msgstr "审查性能与所有权"

#: ../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/guides/provider-porting.md:242
msgid ""
"Measure the selected empty image and the same fixture after enabling the new"
" mode. Report Flash LOAD, Flash footprint, each RAM domain and reserved "
"task/IO storage separately. Hot IRQ work should directly access its fixed "
"provider; an interface lookup is a cold action. Keep bounded admission and "
"stream metadata operations independent of queue length where their contracts"
" require it."
msgstr ""
"测量所选空镜像和同一夹具启用新模式后的镜像。分别报告 Flash LOAD、Flash 占用范围、各 RAM 域和预留任务／I/O 存储。高频 IRQ "
"应直接访问固定提供者；接口查找属于冷路径。在合同要求时，准入判定和流元数据操作保持有界，并且不随队列长度增长。"

#: ../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/guides/provider-porting.md:248
msgid ""
"A passing host register model proves its modeled software scope. New CPU, "
"Cache, FPU/MVE, security or low-power behavior needs its own actual "
"execution boundary; [platform support](../reference/platforms/support.md) "
"does not infer it from a name."
msgstr ""
"通过的主机寄存器模型只证明其建模的软件范围。新增 "
"CPU、缓存、FPU／MVE、安全或低功耗行为必须建立自己的实际执行边界；[平台支持](../reference/platforms/support.md)不能仅凭名称推导它们。"
